[00:00.74] (Hy Heath)
[00:01.18] So you and your true love have parted
[00:07.58] And you've left her all alone
[00:12.34] Dont hesitate, until it's too late
[00:16.34] Just say that the fault was your own.
[00:20.70] Chorus:
[00:20.92] Run boy, fast as you can
[00:25.02] Back to the one who loves only you
[00:29.00] Tell her your sorry you had to part
[00:33.14] And don't break her heart in two.
[00:36.74] Just tell her you can't live without her
[00:43.54] And don't let this be the end
[00:44.90] Don't let your pride, cast your love aside
[00:49.56] Go back and start over again.
[00:53.34] Chorus:
[00:53.58] Run boy, as fast as you can
[00:58.24] Back to the one who loves only you
[01:02.00] Tell her you'll never roam again
[01:06.08] And dont break her heart in two.
[01:27.14] Go back and ask her to forgive you
[01:30.82] For doubting a love so true
[01:35.32] Dont be ashamed to say you are to blame
[01:39.50] Her arms are still yearning for you.
[01:43.88] Chorus:
[01:44.10] Run boy, fast as you can
[01:48.20] Back to the one who loves only you
[01:52.00] Tell her your sorry you had to part
[02:25.96] And don't break her heart in two...
